  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to national non-technical survey capability Increase community safety and accelerate access to safe lands through non-technical Survey, risk education, and targeted agricultural interventions in Kherson oblast</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerate agricultural recovery in Kherson by expanding NTS, clearing EO, and delivering risk education. In partnership, UNOPS and FAO will strengthen local capacity and support vulnerable farmers - especially women - to safely resume climate-adapted agriculture.</narrative>
